# English for Community — Project Context

> AI-powered English communication learning platform.
> This document is the **single source of truth** for any AI agent working in this codebase.

---

## 1. Project Overview

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| **Project name** | English for Community (E4C) |
| **Goal** | A comprehensive English learning platform focusing on 4 core skills (Listening, Speaking, Reading, Writing) + Vocabulary, powered by AI assistance |
| **Target users** | Vietnamese learners (primary), international users (secondary) |
| **Platforms** | Android, iOS (Flutter), Web-ready backend |
| **Monorepo** | `english_for_community/` (Flutter app) + `english_for_community_backend/` (Node.js API) |

