## 8. Key Domain Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Listening Dictation** | Audio playback → user fills gaps → backend scores |
| **Listening Comprehension** | Full audio + MCQ questions → scoring |
| **Speaking** | Read-aloud / free-speaking → STT + AI scoring (pronunciation, fluency, accuracy) |
| **Reading** | Passages with exercises → AI feedback on comprehension |
| **Writing** | Topic-based writing → AI evaluation (grammar, structure, vocabulary) |
| **Vocabulary** | Personal word bank + SRS (Spaced Repetition) review sessions |
| **Dictionary** | Offline SQLite dictionary (`assets/db/dictionary.db`) |
| **AI Chat** | AI assistant for learning help (Gemini / OpenAI / Groq) |
| **Progress & Gamification** | Daily goals, streaks, points, levels, leaderboard |
| **Notifications** | Push (FCM) + local + smart scheduled reminders |
| **Admin Console** | Full CMS: user management, content CRUD, submission review, reports, analytics |

---

## 9. Important Notes

- **Cursor AI preferred**: This project is optimized for AI-assisted development with Cursor.
- **Firebase**: Used for Auth (Google Sign-In), Cloud Messaging (FCM), and Analytics. NOT used as primary database.
- **MongoDB Atlas**: Primary database. All data stored in MongoDB.
- **Cloudinary**: Image/file storage (avatars, audio files).
- **Deployment**: Backend deployed on Render (`english-for-community.onrender.com`). Toggle `_useLocal` in `ApiConfig` for dev.
- **Socket.IO**: Used for real-time features (online status, notifications, collaborative comments).
- **Localization**: Always add new strings to BOTH `app_en.arb` AND `app_vi.arb`.
- **VAPI**: Voice AI service for free speaking practice. Config in `core/config/vapi_env_config.dart`.
